OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Clara
OL,6,G     Schumann and her Circle
OL,7,     F2/5. Donald Macleod meets the
OL,8,     Ffriends (and foes) of composer
OL,9,     FClara Schumann. Today, her peer
OL,10,     Fand fierce rival: Franz Liszt.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FKatie introduces live music from
OL,13,     Ftwo star performers - Theotime
OL,14,     FLanglois de Swarte and Jasdeep
OL,15,     FSingh Degun.
OL,16,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,17,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Fsoundscape of classical music.
